{"id":569,"slug":"winter-light","title":"Winter Light","year":1963,"country":"Sweden","duration":81,"spine":210,"url":"https://www.criterion.com/films/569-winter-light","cover":"https://s3.amazonaws.com/criterion-production/films/615a2701a468f8fe623d2263f828f9ae/XD9sCchJ9xSddcTuSfcjt9jLrobYC4_large.jpg","description":"“God, why hast thou forsaken me?” With Winter Light, Ingmar Bergman explores the search for redemption in a meaningless existence. Small-town pastor Tomas Ericsson (Gunnar Björnstrand) performs his duties mechanically before a dwindling congregation, including his stubbornly devoted lover, Märta (Ingrid Thulin). When he is asked to assuage a troubled parishioner’s (Max von Sydow) debilitating fear of nuclear annihilation, Tomas is terrified to find that he can provide nothing but his own doubt. The beautifully photographed Winter Light is an unsettling look at the human craving for personal validation in a world seemingly abandoned by God.","boxset":0,"scraped":1,"directors":[{"name":"Ingmar Bergman","slug":"ingmar-bergman"}],"cast":[{"actor":"Gunnar Björnstrand","role":"Tomas Ericsson","slug":"gunnar-bjornstrand"},{"actor":"Ingrid Thulin","role":"Märta Lundberg","slug":"ingrid-thulin"},{"actor":"Gunnel Lindblom","role":"Karin Persson","slug":"gunnel-lindblom"},{"actor":"Max von Sydow","role":"Jonas Persson","slug":"max-von-sydow"},{"actor":"Allan Edwall","role":"Algot Frövik","slug":"allan-edwall"},{"actor":"Kolbjörn Knudsen","role":"Knut Aronsson","slug":"kolbjorn-knudsen"},{"actor":"Olof Thunberg","role":"Fredrik Blom, organist","slug":"olof-thunberg"},{"actor":"Elsa Ebbesen","role":"Magdalena Ledfors","slug":"elsa-ebbesen"},{"actor":"Eddie Axberg","role":"Johan Strand","slug":"eddie-axberg"}],"credits":[{"role":"Director","person":"Ingmar Bergman","slug":"ingmar-bergman"},{"role":"Written by","person":"Ingmar Bergman","slug":"ingmar-bergman"},{"role":"Cinematographer","person":"Sven Nykvist","slug":"sven-nykvist"},{"role":"Editor","person":"Ulla Ry